<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FPL Group raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FPL Group raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it upgraded FPL Group Inc to outperform from &quot;outperform long-term.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said raised the 1997 earnings estimate to $3.44 a share from $3.36 a share.</p>
<p>-- FPL gained 1/8 to 44.</p>
</text>
